<%@ include file="fragments/head.jspf" %><section class="audience-page"><div class="audience-hero customer-hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">For customers &#183; thoughtful buying</div><h1>Find the piece. Follow its journey.</h1><p>Explore Tamil Nadu&#8217;s craft traditions, learn about the maker and follow an order from acceptance through making, packing and delivery.</p><a class="black-pill" href="/products">Browse TN ARTISAN <b>&#8594;</b></a><a class="story-text-link" href="/login/customer">Customer sign in</a></div><div class="audience-art"><span>&#2980;&#2990;&#3007;&#2996;&#3021;&#2984;&#3006;&#2975;&#3009;</span><small>CRAFT &#183; PLACE &#183; MAKER</small></div></div><div class="feature-list"><article><b>01</b><h2>Discover by tradition</h2><p>Search product names and descriptions, browse categories and narrow the collection by price or availability.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h2>Know who made it</h2><p>Listings include maker profiles, district, materials and technique, with a craft passport for product context.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h2>Checkout with clarity</h2><p>Add a shipping address and select Razorpay online checkout or cash on delivery. Online orders are fulfilled only after the payment provider confirms capture.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h2>Follow your order</h2><p>Check actual order events, payment references, the delivery address, product details, courier references and a map of the delivery locality.</p></article></div><div class="source-note">Your account email and orders are stored in the project database. Product estimates should be confirmed with the artisan. Automatic courier GPS requires a shipping carrier integration.</div></section><%@ include file="fragments/foot.jspf" %>
